#### 5. Eager Test
**Test:** `OrderProcessor_FullWorkflow_Succeeds` (line 52)  
**Evidence:** Calls **7 distinct production methods** (Validate, CalculateTotal, ApplyDiscount, ReserveInventory, ProcessPayment, SendConfirmation, UpdateOrderHistory).
```csharp
